'''Oak leaves''' are biome-colored [[leaves]] that form the canopy of [[oak]] trees and [[jungle bush]]es, and can drop [[apple]]s. 

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
[[Hoe]]s are the default tools for breaking leaves, but leaves can be obtained only with [[shears]] or tools [[enchanted]] with [[Silk Touch]].

{{breaking row|horizontal=1|Oak Leaves|Hoe|drop=0|shears=1|sword=0}}

Without shears, oak leaves can drop 1 [[oak sapling]], 1—2 [[stick]]s, and 1 [[apple]]. [[Fortune]] increases the chances.
